## How can my institution support the project?

Members of the IIIF Consortium can support Allmaps through the
[IIIF–Allmaps Partnership](/iiif-partnership). You can also
[contact us](/contact) about funding development or commissioning work.

Help people discover and use your maps by linking to Allmaps from map records in
your collection portal. Links to Allmaps Editor invite people to georeference
your maps, while links to Allmaps Viewer let them explore maps that have already
been georeferenced.

