## What about sustainability?

Allmaps is designed so that the georeference data you create remains useful
beyond the project itself. [The data is open](/data) and uses the Georeference
Annotation standard, so you can download it, preserve it and reuse it in other tools.

Our open source libraries and plugins let you display maps on your own website
using your own copies of the annotations, without depending on Allmaps’ hosted
services. The original map images remain with the institutions that publish them
through IIIF.

<a href="{docsBaseUrl}/georeference-annotations">Learn about Georeference Annotations</a>.

